<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 1.83 pts off FTSE on Nov 25.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 1.83 pts off FTSE on Nov 25.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE-100 stocks will trade ex-dividend on November 25. Analysts estimate this will take 1.83 points off the FTSE 100.</p>
<p>					   DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>					   (PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>     COMPANY			   Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>  * BOC Group Plc		    14.5  18.13    0.512</p>
<p>  * Land Securities Plc	    7.35  9.19     0.274</p>
<p>  * Next Plc			   5.0   6.25     0.137</p>
<p>  * PowerGen Plc		     7.8   9.75     0.382</p>
<p>  * Vodafone Group Plc	     2.36  2.95     0.528</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
